{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer stuck in Limbo, you've noticed Hell could be far more comfortable with just a few... improvements. Unfortunately, the demonic residents disagree. Your only option: dig to the bottom and overthrow Satan himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/af30ef13584cfbc1cd013eb6e994410a.poster.avif?t=1755289659\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/af30ef13584cfbc1cd013eb6e994410a.webm?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/af30ef13584cfbc1cd013eb6e994410a.mp4?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ONLY WAY FORWARD IS DOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your trusty pick-axe and an explosive arsenal, you must dig the hell out of Hell. Explore a world heavily inspired by Dante's Inferno, populated by the legendary characters and mythical creatures from the poem itself. Mine the terrain for valuable resources, but be prepared to die. A lot. Luckily, every time you die, you wake up in Limbo with all your gear intact. So dig, upgrade, and come back stronger until nothing can stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/d4ee6c0780a4228fb4bfaabf7a5693a0.poster.avif?t=1755289659\" width=616 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/d4ee6c0780a4228fb4bfaabf7a5693a0.webm?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/d4ee6c0780a4228fb4bfaabf7a5693a0.mp4?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE TO GOD-LIKE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vicious Loop</i> offers a huge range of upgrades that radically change how you play. Unlock new abilities, starting with essentials like dashing and air jumps, and escalating to game-changers like flight or smashing into the ground with explosive force. But that's just the beginning. Forge explosive, ricocheting bullets, construct a self-repairing exosuit, and find countless ways to exponentially increase your power. Smart choices will be the key to overcoming the unique challenges of each circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/ef1c5b2ba66270db89a67071864bd367.poster.avif?t=1755289659\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/ef1c5b2ba66270db89a67071864bd367.webm?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/ef1c5b2ba66270db89a67071864bd367.mp4?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR WAY DOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each circle of Hell is crawling with enemies who\u2019d rather see you buried than pass through. Learn their attack patterns, exploit their weaknesses, and defeat epic bosses to descend further. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll face the ultimate showdown with Satan himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948390?t=1755289659","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948390?t=1755289659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/a2a237a9d883b37484948ddd35c536315715c149/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755289659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/a2a237a9d883b37484948ddd35c536315715c149/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755289659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There are blood effects as you fight demons."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an engineer stuck in Limbo, you've noticed Hell could be far more comfortable with just a few... improvements. Unfortunately, the demonic residents disagree. Your only option: dig to the bottom and overthrow Satan himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/af30ef13584cfbc1cd013eb6e994410a.poster.avif?t=1755289659\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/af30ef13584cfbc1cd013eb6e994410a.webm?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/af30ef13584cfbc1cd013eb6e994410a.mp4?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ONLY WAY FORWARD IS DOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your trusty pick-axe and an explosive arsenal, you must dig the hell out of Hell. Explore a world heavily inspired by Dante's Inferno, populated by the legendary characters and mythical creatures from the poem itself. Mine the terrain for valuable resources, but be prepared to die. A lot. Luckily, every time you die, you wake up in Limbo with all your gear intact. So dig, upgrade, and come back stronger until nothing can stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/d4ee6c0780a4228fb4bfaabf7a5693a0.poster.avif?t=1755289659\" width=616 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/d4ee6c0780a4228fb4bfaabf7a5693a0.webm?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/d4ee6c0780a4228fb4bfaabf7a5693a0.mp4?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE TO GOD-LIKE POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vicious Loop</i> offers a huge range of upgrades that radically change how you play. Unlock new abilities, starting with essentials like dashing and air jumps, and escalating to game-changers like flight or smashing into the ground with explosive force. But that's just the beginning. Forge explosive, ricocheting bullets, construct a self-repairing exosuit, and find countless ways to exponentially increase your power. Smart choices will be the key to overcoming the unique challenges of each circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/ef1c5b2ba66270db89a67071864bd367.poster.avif?t=1755289659\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/ef1c5b2ba66270db89a67071864bd367.webm?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/extras/ef1c5b2ba66270db89a67071864bd367.mp4?t=1755289659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR WAY DOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each circle of Hell is crawling with enemies who\u2019d rather see you buried than pass through. Learn their attack patterns, exploit their weaknesses, and defeat epic bosses to descend further. Survive long enough, and you\u2019ll face the ultimate showdown with Satan himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Smashroom Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948390/28673716110fc1e475ea6da5367bbf75af9162f6/header.jpg?t=1755289659","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948390/18476132/a5204c21a8ceb99373ca10e42b565526b98a0c9c/1755100469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755289654","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948390/18476132/a5204c21a8ceb99373ca10e42b565526b98a0c9c/1755100469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755289654","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948390/18476132/a5204c21a8ceb99373ca10e42b565526b98a0c9c/1755100469/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755289654","id":257182688,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182688/a754f3be63c3a376564ce39fd1b2c293cc8aa916/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755289654"}],"name":"Vicious Loop","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 21H1 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core\u2122 Duo or faster<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Smashroom Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00